      "comment": "DASHING JOEY (8) is a newcomer for the Gavin Harris kennel. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Lot to like about his profile and expected to run well. BIG BOOTS CHARLI (7) jumped from the middle and showed promise on debut, filling a minor placing at this track over 342m (20.22). Can feature in the finish again. REGAL MACK (4) continues to race well but is struggling to break through, placing at his last five runs. Last time finished last over 530m at this track beaten 9 lengths (32.09) behind Vic Jake in a Maiden on November 19. Well-placed to take this out. IMPRESS DORY (2) collected a minor prize last start at big odds and must be considered.",
